===== why no third pass =====
After the CLOSING pass the checkpoint.md text changed once more (the
'取数时间' line).  That cannot move any reading, and this is checked
rather than assumed: the ONLY use of checkpoint.md in scripts/ is
  verify_delivery_governance.py:121  if not (... / "checkpoint.md").is_file():
i.e. an existence test.  Its content is parsed by nothing, so a text edit
to it is invisible to all six gates.  (Contrast T-06's exemption claim of
the same shape, which was WRONG in the opposite direction: there the
absence of any parser was the DEFECT.)
